Breaks: python3-pydantic (<< 2.46.0)
Description: Core validation logic for Pydantic (Rust-compiled extension)
 pydantic-core provides the high-performance Rust-compiled validation
 and serialization engine that powers Pydantic v2.
 .
 This package ships the prebuilt wheel for the current platform and
 Python version, as the Rust toolchain required to compile from source
 (rustc >= 1.88) is not available in the standard Debian build infrastructure.
